AC->BNY

/* Check whether an array is already sorted ascending */

Make sorted_check func(arr)
    i = 1
    WHILST i < length arr
        IF arr[i] > arr[i + 1]
            return 0
        i += 1
    return 1

<mainloop>
    Term.display sorted_check([1, 2, 3, 4])
    Term.display sorted_check([1, 3, 2])
<mainloop>
